 Darkwind Legends
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 Attaining Legend status on Darkwind is mostly a
 status symbol at the moment. To earn the title
 of Legend, you must reach level 65. Players that
 have reached this status will have [LGND] in place
 of their level on the who list.

 Currently, the only benefit given to a Legend
 other then prestige, is the ability to change
 their title at will with the 'ltitle' command.
 A few Legend-guilds are in the works to be
 created in the near future for Legend players to
 join, giving them new powers and abilities.
